      <bioghist encodinganalog="545">
         <head>Biographical/Historical Information</head>
         <p>The Auctioneers Board was established in 1983. A five-member board establishes regulations for obtaining and retaining certification, examines auctioneers for certification, and provides licensure/certification to the approximately 1,500 auctioneers and firms in Virginia. The Department of Professional and Occupational Regulation provides administrative support to the board.</p>
      </bioghist>
      <odd encodinganalog="500">
         <p>These records are part of the Virginia Dept. of Professional and Occupational Regulation record group (RG 17)</p>
      </odd>
